        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Battle of Britain (film)\n- People: Hugh Dowding, Laurence Olivier, Trevor Howard, Keith Park\n- Roles: Air Chief Marshal, Royal Air Force officer\n\nFacts:\n- Hugh Dowding was born on 24 April 1882.\n- Hugh Dowding was an officer in the Royal Air Force and held the rank of Air Chief Marshal.\n- The film Battle of Britain cast respected British actors to play key figures in the battle.\n- In Battle of Britain, Laurence Olivier played Hugh Dowding.\n- In Battle of Britain, Trevor Howard played Keith Park.\n- Hugh Dowding died on 15 February 1970.",
